        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pydro/{size}/1844_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-11-20T16:30:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It doesn't have to be that complicated: Tachyon has her redirect ready, and there is a minion that can deal 3 damage and target her. If that target goes first, she can protect herself and&nbsp;destroy a target that will attack later (possibly saving 10 hp in a 5 player game), if it doesn't target Tachy first, she can only protect herself, while everyone takes damage (the AoE attacks only deal 2 damage).</p>",
        "post_number": 22,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:54:33.450Z",
